{
  "folder": "11 - Polling & Lifecycle Flows (Runner)",
  "description": "## Polling & Lifecycle Flows (Collection Runner)\nComposable flows via `postman.setNextRequest` - run these from the **Collection Runner** (set delay 1000 ms).\n\n- **Flow A:** Generate QR -> poll until settled -> get details -> refund.\n- **Flow B:** Link account -> get token -> charge -> renew -> remove.\n\nFallback: when run as single requests, each step still saves the variables the next step needs (`{{last_tran_id}}`, `{{pwt}}`, `{{request_id}}`).",
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Flow B - README: run the flows",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "https://developer.payway.com.kh/",
          "protocol": "https",
          "host": [
            "developer",
            "payway",
            "com",
            "kh"
          ],
          "path": []
        },
        "description": "## Collection Runner flows\nOpen the **Collection Runner**: select folder **11 - Polling & Lifecycle Flows (Runner)** and keep iteration order. The arrows below are wired with `postman.setNextRequest` so they work even when each request is sent individually.\n\n### Flow A - QR purchase -> poll -> details -> refund\n`A1 Create QR` -> `A2 Poll Transaction Status` (loops while `data.payment_status_code` = 2 PENDING, max `{{max_polls}}`) -> `A3 Get Details` -> `A4 Refund`\n\n### Flow B - CoF lifecycle\n`B1 Link Account` -> `B2 Get Token Details` (saves {{pwt}}/{{ctid}}) -> `B3 Payment using Token` -> `B4 Renew` -> `B5 Remove`\n\nIn the Runner, set **delay = 1000 ms** so callbacks/polling have time.\n\n> Poll loop: `{{poll_count}}` increments each poll; `{{max_polls}}` = 10. Payment status `2` (PENDING) or \"not visible yet\" loops; any settled status moves on."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "A1 - Create QR",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          },
          "raw": "{\n  \"req_time\": \"{{req_time}}\",\n  \"merchant_id\": \"{{merchant_id}}\",\n  \"tran_id\": \"{{tran_id}}\",\n  \"amount\": \"{{amount}}\",\n  \"items\": \"{{items_b64}}\",\n  \"first_name\": \"{{buyer_first_name}}\",\n  \"last_name\": \"{{buyer_last_name}}\",\n  \"email\": \"{{buyer_email}}\",\n  \"phone\": \"{{buyer_phone}}\",\n  \"purchase_type\": \"{{purchase_type}}\",\n  \"payment_option\": \"{{payment_option}}\",\n  \"callback_url\": \"{{callback_url_b64}}\",\n  \"return_deeplink\": \"{{return_deeplink_b64}}\",\n  \"currency\": \"{{currency}}\",\n  \"custom_fields\": \"{{custom_fields_b64}}\",\n  \"return_params\": \"{{return_params}}\",\n  \"payout\": \"{{payout_b64}}\",\n  \"lifetime\": \"{{lifetime}}\",\n  \"qr_image_template\": \"{{qr_image_template}}\",\n  \"hash\": \"{{computed_hash}}\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/payment-gateway/v1/payments/generate-qr",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "payment-gateway",
            "v1",
            "payments",
            "generate-qr"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Flow A step 1. Creates a KHQR. Sandbox note: the KHQR stays PENDING until paid. PayWay may push a callback when it settles; `transaction-detail` always sees the record, unlike check-transaction-2 (recent-window, card transactions)."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "// Restore the shared PayWay helper library (Postman runs every script in its own scope):",
              "var __h = pm.collectionVariables.get('__helpers');",
              "if (!__h) throw new Error('The `__helpers` collection variable is missing - re-import the full collection JSON (it holds the shared helper library source).');",
              "eval(__h);",
              "var C = pm.collectionVariables;",
              "C.set('poll_count', '0');",
              "C.set('poll_status', '');",
              "var reqTime = utcNow();",
              "var tranId = genTranId();",
              "var amount = fmtAmt(C.get('amount'));",
              "var itemsB64 = b64json((C.get('items_json') || '').trim() || '[{\"name\":\"QR Poll\",\"quantity\":1,\"price\":0.10}]');",
              "var cbB64 = ensureB64(C.get('callback_url'));",
              "var rdl = b64json((C.get('return_deeplink_raw')||'').trim());",
              "var customB64 = b64json((C.get('custom_fields_json')||'').trim());",
              "var payoutB64 = b64json((C.get('payout_json')||'').trim());",
              "var rparams = (C.get('return_params_raw')||'').trim();",
              "var msg = reqTime + C.get('merchant_id') + tranId + amount + itemsB64",
              "  + C.get('buyer_first_name') + C.get('buyer_last_name') + C.get('buyer_email') + C.get('buyer_phone')",
              "  + C.get('purchase_type') + C.get('payment_option') + cbB64 + rdl + C.get('currency')",
              "  + customB64 + rparams + payoutB64 + C.get('lifetime') + C.get('qr_image_template');",
              "C.set('req_time', reqTime);",
              "C.set('tran_id', tranId);",
              "C.set('last_tran_id', tranId);",
              "C.set('amount', amount);",
              "C.set('items_b64', itemsB64);",
              "C.set('callback_url_b64', cbB64);",
              "C.set('return_deeplink_b64', rdl);",
              "C.set('custom_fields_b64', customB64);",
              "C.set('payout_b64', payoutB64);",
              "C.set('return_params', rparams);",
              "C.set('computed_hash', hmac512(msg, C.get('secret_key')));",
              "console.log('b4hash:', msg);"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "// Restore the shared PayWay helper library (Postman runs every script in its own scope):",
              "var __h = pm.collectionVariables.get('__helpers');",
              "if (!__h) throw new Error('The `__helpers` collection variable is missing - re-import the full collection JSON (it holds the shared helper library source).');",
              "eval(__h);",
              "var j = {};",
              "try { j = pm.response.json(); } catch (e) {}",
              "if (okStatus(j)) {",
              "  pm.collectionVariables.set('last_tran_id', pm.collectionVariables.get('tran_id'));",
              "  pm.test('QR created (status.code 0)', function () { pm.expect(okStatus(j)).to.eql(true); });",
              "  if (j.qrString) console.log('qrString:', String(j.qrString).slice(0, 48) + '... (scan with the ABA sandbox app, or wait for the auto-callback)');",
              "} else if (j.status) {",
              "  console.log('QR business error', j.status.code, '-', j.status.message);",
              "}",
              "var vj = {}; try { vj = pm.response.json(); } catch (e) {}",
              "if (vj.qrImage || vj.qrString) visualizeQr(vj.qrImage, vj.qrString, 'Flow A - scan with the ABA Mobile app (sandbox). A2 will poll this transaction. tran_id: ' + pm.collectionVariables.get('tran_id'));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "A2 - Poll Transaction Status (loops)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          },
          "raw": "{\n  \"req_time\": \"{{req_time}}\",\n  \"merchant_id\": \"{{merchant_id}}\",\n  \"tran_id\": \"{{last_tran_id}}\",\n  \"hash\": \"{{computed_hash}}\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/payment-gateway/v1/payments/transaction-detail",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "payment-gateway",
            "v1",
            "payments",
            "transaction-detail"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Flow A step 2. **Polling loop** via Get Transaction Details (works for QR *and* card transactions - sandbox-verified that check-transaction-2 cannot see KHQR records). Recomputes the hash every iteration and calls itself via `postman.setNextRequest` while `data.payment_status_code` is `2` (PENDING) or the record is not visible yet, up to `{{max_polls}}` tries. Run in the Collection Runner with delay >= 1000 ms."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "// Restore the shared PayWay helper library (Postman runs every script in its own scope):",
              "var __h = pm.collectionVariables.get('__helpers');",
              "if (!__h) throw new Error('The `__helpers` collection variable is missing - re-import the full collection JSON (it holds the shared helper library source).');",
              "eval(__h);",
              "var C = pm.collectionVariables;",
              "var reqTime = utcNow();",
              "var tranId = C.get('last_tran_id') || C.get('tran_id');",
              "if (!tranId) throw new Error('No tran_id to poll - run A1 first (sets {{last_tran_id}}).');",
              "var msg = reqTime + C.get('merchant_id') + tranId;",
              "C.set('req_time', reqTime);",
              "C.set('tran_id', tranId);",
              "C.set('computed_hash', hmac512(msg, C.get('secret_key')));",
              "console.log('poll b4hash:', msg);"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "// Restore the shared PayWay helper library (Postman runs every script in its own scope):",
              "var __h = pm.collectionVariables.get('__helpers');",
              "if (!__h) throw new Error('The `__helpers` collection variable is missing - re-import the full collection JSON (it holds the shared helper library source).');",
              "eval(__h);",
              "var C = pm.collectionVariables;",
              "var count = parseInt(C.get('poll_count') || '0', 10) + 1;",
              "var max = parseInt(C.get('max_polls') || '10', 10);",
              "C.set('poll_count', String(count));",
              "var j = {};",
              "try { j = pm.response.json(); } catch (e) {}",
              "var sc = respCode(j);",
              "// transaction status lives in data.payment_status_code (sandbox-verified):",
              "// 0 approved | 2 pending | 3 declined | 4 refunded | 7 cancelled",
              "var pay = j.data && j.data.payment_status_code !== undefined ? String(j.data.payment_status_code) : '';",
              "C.set('poll_status', pay || sc);",
              "pm.test('Poll ' + count + '/' + max + ' - status ' + (pay || sc || 'n/a'), function () { pm.expect(sc).to.not.be.empty; });",
              "var pending = pay === '2' || (sc !== '0' && sc !== '00');",
              "if (pending && count < max) {",
              "  postman.setNextRequest('A2 - Poll Transaction Status (loops)');",
              "  console.log('payment_status:', (j.data && j.data.payment_status) || 'not visible yet', '- polling again (' + count + '/' + max + ')');",
              "} else {",
              "  postman.setNextRequest('A3 - Get Transaction Details');",
              "  console.log('final payment_status:', (j.data && j.data.payment_status) || sc, '- iteration', count + '/' + max);",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "A3 - Get Transaction Details",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
